  triage:title "finalize_sent_ack_outcome takes 12 loose parameters" ;
  triage:description "finalize_sent_ack_outcome (crates/atm-core/src/ack/mod.rs:575) takes 12 loose parameters. A clippy::too_many_arguments override is already documented, but the parameter list is a real structural smell. A SentAckReply struct bundling the reply-specific fields would consolidate it." ;
